base image not pinned by digest
the final image is a debug or floating tag
USER must be a numeric non-root uid and gid
the final stage runs or fetches something
the final stage copies from the build context
a secret-looking variable in the image
ENTRYPOINT must be the exec form
ADD is not allowed
`cargo build` without --locked
`pnpm install` without --frozen-lockfile
a download piped into a shell
a download that is not checked with sha256sum -c
